            2. Power Vent vs Direct Vent vs Atmospheric vs Condensing
          </h2>

          <p>
            Gas water heaters are sorted by how they get rid of exhaust, and the names are easy to mix up. Before you buy, look at how the old heater vents and where the new one has to go. The venting type decides the install cost more than the brand does.
          </p>

